                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.05/156: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-27T12:00:00-04:00">July 27,
                    1929—noon</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>251. Your 626, July 25, 11 a.m. The draft note quoted in your telegram is
                    acceptable to the Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
